  "briefing": "A short scenario to learn the ropes. Raiders have made the Drift their hunting ground, and their dens keep launching new raider packs. The Ceres Free Traders are a neutral minor power: stay at peace and on good terms (gifts help) and they pay you trade income.\n\n[b]Goal:[/b] destroy the raiders: take their den at [b]Rustholm[/b] and hunt down their fleets.\n\n[b]Getting started[/b]\n- Click a fleet, then a blue hex to move. Move into an enemy fleet to start a battle: fight it yourself or auto-resolve.\n- Move into an unclaimed star system to claim it, then click it to open the [b]system view[/b] and develop its worlds: colonies on habitable planets, mining bases on rocks and belts, research stations on ice moons and gas giants.\n- [b]E[/b] Empire: research and diplomacy.  [b]H[/b] Heroes.  [b]Space[/b] end turn.  [b]Esc[/b] menu.\n- The purple crystals are missions for a fleet with a ready commander.",
  "battle_max_rounds": 30,
  "default_battle_map": "open_space",
